WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:03,020
Brother Wenwen must like sister Xixi

2
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:05,020
Real or fake? How do you know?

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:08,300
Doesn’t Su Xi have a senior whom she has had a crush on for many years?

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:11,300
Because of the way Brother Wenwen looks at Sister Xixi

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,300
Sometimes my dad looks at my mom

6
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:18,300
Sister, which brother do you not like?

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,300
Don't get married so early

8
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:24,300
When you have a baby, you will like him or not me.

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:28,300
The second aunt's grandma said, if my parents give me a younger brother or sister,

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,300
You won't like me either

11
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,300
This is all a mess

12
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:35,300
Don't listen to what others say, feel it yourself

13
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:37,300
Do you think your parents are like this?

14
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:40,840
But I'm afraid of what might happen

15
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:45,120
They won't, they love you very much

16
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:57,707
You guys guard Brother Liu

17
00:00:57,707 --> 00:01:04,001
protect people

18
00:01:04,001 --> 00:01:14,490
Also optimistic about food
